    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>戒指，非普通</em></p><p>这枚镶有萤石的金戒指可以使佩戴者的思维更加敏锐。戒指有3发充能，每日黎明时恢复[[/r 1d4 - 1]]发已消耗充能。当你进行一次智力检定时，你可以消耗1发充能使你在这次检定中获得优势。</p><p>This gold ring bears a fluorite stone and is enchanted to sharpen the wearer's mind.</p><p>The ring has 3 charges and regains [[/r 1d4 - 1]] expended charges daily at dawn. When you make an Intelligence check, you can expend 1 charge to grant yourself advantage on the check.</p>",
